2650:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         it should be preliminarily stopped using function
2651:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         @ref HAL_ADCEx_InjectedStop().
